  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 302.05 No Pledge or Assignment. The trust documents shall prohibit the transfer or assignment of any interest in a trust account as security for a loan or for any other purpose.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9585, eff 11-2-09; ss by #11097, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
